OL,3,GNEWSAJudge says legal appeal on
OL,4,ADrumcree parade ban not an 'emergency'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA High Court judge says a legal appeal
OL,7,Fby Orangemen following the secretary of
OL,8,Fstate's decision to ban the Drumcree
OL,9,Fparade is not an emergency case.
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,12,FBryant banned the contentious Orange
OL,13,FOrder parade at Drumcree on Friday
OL,14,Fsaying the decision "was in the best
OL,15,Finterests of peace".
OL,17,FOrangemen in Portadown went to the High
OL,18,FCourt on Saturday afternoon to seek a
OL,19,Fjudicial review of that decision.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
